								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/statistics/median-of-grouped-data" class="sidebar-lesson active">
								<span>03</span>
								<div>
									<strong>Median & Empirical Rule</strong>
									<small>3 Median = Mode + 2 Mean</small>
								</div>
							</a>

							<a href="/statistics/pyqs" class="sidebar-lesson">
								<span>04</span>
								<div>
